// SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-3.0-or-later
// Part of akantu-rs, a Rust port of Akantu (EPFL/LSMS). Differential tests
// against the oracle fixtures fixtures/model/contact/* generated by
// oracle/probes/contact/contact_probe.cc (upstream ContactMechanicsModel
// through CouplerSolidContact). Every comparison is bitwise — identical bit
// patterns, signed zeros and NaN payloads distinguished (stricter than
// D-046, which also accepts default quiet NaNs differing only in the sign
// bit; no contact fixture contains a NaN, which `cases` asserts, so the two
// rules coincide; the akantu-validation D-046 comparator is not on main yet
// and replaces `assert_bits` when it lands) — with the upstream-
// compatibility switches of the defects each case reaches
// (docs/NUMERICAL_VALIDATION.md).

